        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2044, Empire Arch Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Empire Arch Pocket Door Passage Set is great for sliding pocket doors as well as barn doors. It comes packaged as a complete set with two arched flush pulls and a mortise box for a finger edge pull. The Edge pull itself is spring loaded and can retract completely into the box for a clean look once installed. When needed, simply press the button, and the edge pull will pop out! The Empire Arch Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware has a 1/8 inch face plate projection. Choose from your favorite of Emtek's most stunning finish color options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-dummy-set-emtek-2046\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-privacy-set-emtek-2045\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2043\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the #8 Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2044-specifications.pdf?v=1704262425\"><b>Emtek 2044 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
